        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-d585b2821829f1fdbfcb5695",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Buenos Aires"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:highlight_text:053ddcb01c906c15",
      "field": "highlight.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "38bd4a46837737853f3a3b936e4d53b03da3baf5a613d0583c44009a0872a397",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-d585b2821829f1fdbfcb5695",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Spend the first few days in Argentina's capital. You will see historic neighbourhoods, Plaza de Mayo and Casa Rosada, spend a day at a gaucho ranch, and enjoy an evening tango show with dinner."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_alt:eab07c1fbf5a7dea",
      "field": "media.alt",
      "sourceTextSha256": "39af6d3496e76a3daa756528a506da43e2c8d3965a982debebd83e28c8c66747",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-d585b2821829f1fdbfcb5695",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Casa Rosada behind the equestrian monument in Plaza de Mayo, Buenos Aires, Argentina"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_hover:7f0499c47d62552c",
      "field": "media.hover",
      "sourceTextSha256": "5a2ff60ef5b3e00e9df429bcf026dd2fa790dcde4406362b734b9096927ed5d4",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-d585b2821829f1fdbfcb5695",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Buenos Aires: the pink façade of Casa Rosada by the palm trees and the square"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:highlight_title:c816a8c5f2c7ad9b",
      "field": "highlight.title",
      "sourceTextSha256": "7f6fbb2addf7cb0de02c9f3f2679777dc9729311709e1abd802511819831c15e",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-d585b2821829f1fdbfcb5695",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Puerto Madryn and the Valdés Peninsula"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:highlight_text:ff5028eb7ab76832",
      "field": "highlight.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "428d842cb55bc7658cbabf1f7dc52883708ff1dfa3eb873bbf3bc72d716406b9",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-d585b2821829f1fdbfcb5695",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "On the Patagonian coast, you can watch for whales from shore before taking a boat trip from Puerto Pirámides. The Valdés Peninsula is known for its southern right whales, fur seals, elephant seals, orcas, dolphins and colonies of Magellanic penguins."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_alt:28402bbbb0b87c6b",
      "field": "media.alt",
      "sourceTextSha256": "e06215b331a0032633bb7473f3cd5e348f06b38eae057c3d66d8eed67056c53e",
